# YTube Studio — Optional Build Environment Variables
# Copy to .env locally (never commit .env). In GitHub Actions, set these as Repository Secrets.
# No third-party API keys are required to run YTube Studio.

# Optional Release Signing (used automatically by Gradle release build & GitHub Actions)
# KEYSTORE_PATH=/path/to/your-release-keystore.jks
# STORE_PASSWORD=your_keystore_password
# KEY_PASSWORD=your_key_password
